{% raw %}<section class="band band-photo"><img src="/images/2018/06/Cabinetry_Header-hero.webp" alt="All Wood Cabinets" width="1200" height="900" fetchpriority="high" class="band-img"></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h1>Kitchen Design Services</h1><h2>From Singer Kitchens in New Orleans &amp; the Northshore!</h2><div class="el-text"><p>If you’re like most metro New Orleans families, your kitchen is the heart of your home.</p><p>It’s where you make red beans and rice on Mondays, cook up a pot of jambalaya for a big family meal, and make a batch of gumbo to enjoy while you root for our beloved Saints and LSU Tigers.</p><p>We <em>live</em> in our kitchens and, often, they’re as unique as we are.</p></div><div class="el-block"><div class="video"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIjlff6ige8" title="Kitchen Design New Orleans, Mandeville, Covington &amp; Slidell video" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div><div class="el-text"><p>There's no single kitchen design that works for everyone.</p><p>That’s why, as kitchen designers, we specialize in creating the perfect kitchen for you and your family. We create kitchens that truly fulfill the needs of your lifestyle and reflect your personality, taste, and eye for style.</p><p>At Singer Kitchens, we’re your one-stop shop for thoughtful kitchen design and renovations in the New Orleans Metro area.</p></div><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/request-consultation/">Let’s Work Together To Create Your Dream Kitchen!</a></p></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-block"><h2>SEE What Your Brand New Kitchen Will Look Like!</h2><div class="el-text"><p>It’s easy to dream.</p><p>It’s even easier to SEE what your dream kitchen can look like with our virtual 3D design renderings!</p><p>This isn't some AI drawing from a program. It's a custom-created design based on your input, built by one of our professional kitchen designers.</p></div><figure class="el-img"><a href="/kitchen-design-checklist/"><img src="/images/2021/06/060921b.webp" alt="Kitchen Design New Orleans, Mandeville, Covington &amp; Slidell" width="1080" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a></figure><div class="el-text"><p>Our kitchen design services include a 3D design rendering* so you can see exactly what your new kitchen will look like before renovation begins.</p><p>Our <a href="/uptown-new-orleans-kitchen-renovation-creates-a-meaningful-gathering-place-within-budget/">designers work closely with you</a> to make your vision for your new kitchen layout and floor plan come to life. And if you’re not sure where to start, we can help you develop your vision for your new kitchen using ideas you can see up close in our two renovated <a href="/showrooms/">showrooms</a> and our decades of <a href="/about/">kitchen design expertise</a>.</p><p><em>*This service is free to anyone who chooses to work with us.</em></p></div><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/kitchen-design-secrets/">Learn the secret to designing a modern kitchen you and your family will love!</a></p><div class="el-text"><p>Together, we’ll create your new custom kitchen design, make recommendations on what works, incorporate your feedback &amp; changes, and end with a design custom tailored for you.</p><p>We’ll also provide you with a FREE estimate and we’ll strive to make recommendations that work within your renovation budget for your new space.</p></div><h2>Visit Our Showrooms to Choose Cabinets, Countertops, and Everything in Between!</h2><div class="el-text"><p>It’s always fun to browse kitchen cabinets, countertops, and kitchen storage features online. It’s a great way to get ideas!</p><p>But nothing compares to being able to see, touch, and feel these kitchen elements in person in one of our showrooms.</p><p>Make an appointment to visit one of our two completely renovated showrooms – in New Orleans &amp; Mandeville – and see your options up close.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-block"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><h2>New Orleans</h2><div class="map"><iframe src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=231%20N.%20Carrollton%20Ave%2C%20New%20Orleans&amp;t=m&amp;z=15&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near" title="Map: 231 N. Carrollton Ave, New Orleans" loading="lazy"></iframe></div><div class="el-text"><p>231 N. Carrollton Ave.<br>(at Bienville, across from Brocato's)<br>New Orleans, LA 70119<br>(504) 486-0067<br>Hours: Mon-Fri 10am-5pm, Sat 10am-2pm</p></div></div><div class="el-col"><h2>Mandeville​</h2><div class="map"><iframe src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=316%20Girod%20St%20Mandeville%2C%20LA%2070448&amp;t=m&amp;z=15&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near" title="Map: 316 Girod St Mandeville, LA 70448" loading="lazy"></iframe></div><div class="el-text"><p>316 Girod St.<br>(Old Mandeville)<br>Mandeville, LA 70448<br>(985) 778-2978<br>Hours: Mon-Fri 10am-5pm, Sat 10am-2pm</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-block"><div class="el-text"><p>Feel the cabinetry materials, look at countertop &amp; cabinet colors, evaluate backsplash textures, see soaring kitchen islands, and put your vision to work. We’ll help you every step of the way.</p><p>In our showrooms, you can browse:</p><ul><li><strong>Kitchen Countertops</strong> – Browse <a href="/countertops/">countertops</a> from top brands and in a variety of options including quartz, granite, and laminate.</li><li><strong>Kitchen Cabinets</strong> – Browse <a href="/cabinets/">cabinets</a> from top brands in a variety of styles as well as cabinet hardware including knobs, handles, hinges, and more.</li><li><strong>Kitchen Appliance Recommendations</strong> – While <strong>we don’t sell appliances</strong>, we’re more than happy to provide you with kitchen appliance<strong><em> recommendations</em></strong> – including stoves, refrigerators, dishwashers, microwaves, and garbage disposals from nationwide leading name brands and recommend local vendors for purchasing.</li><li><strong>Kitchen Storage Solution Ideas</strong> – We’re masters at creating efficient kitchen spaces that store it all AND work for you. We’ve got tons of <a href="/21-storage-solutions-to-start-your-2021-off-right/">storage ideas</a> and examples to show you so you can create a space that fits your lifestyle.</li></ul><p><strong>Tons of Layout and Design Ideas</strong> – Take a look at our showroom models, which include some of the most popular <a href="/2021-design-trends-topping-everyones-wish-lists/">kitchen design trends</a> styles, and layouts we’re seeing today. From retro modern to traditional, modern, minimalist, all-white, small kitchen solutions, and more, we've got ideas to share! You can also visit our <a href="/portfolio/">online portfolio</a> and see the results of our recent projects. We’re happy to give you more details on these if you see something you like!</p></div><h2>Our Goal: A Stress-Free Kitchen Renovation Experience</h2><div class="el-text"><p>We know the thought of handling and managing a <a href="/remodeling/">kitchen remodel</a> can be daunting. That’s why we don’t just offer our design services and products, we’re a one-stop vendor for it all!</p></div><figure class="el-img"><a href="/kitchen-design-checklist/"><img src="/images/2020/04/remodeling-checklist-cta-banner.webp" alt="Kitchen Remodeling Checklist, download now" width="800" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a></figure><div class="el-text"><p>We work with our own experienced in-house renovation contractors and installers to get the job done, on time, and done right.</p><p>Plus, our designers will manage your renovation process from beginning to end – as little or as much as you want – taking the stress of coordination off of you.</p><p>We’re in the business of creating DREAM kitchens while making the renovation experience as stress-free as possible for our clients!</p></div><h2>Your Dream Kitchen is Within Easier Reach with Interest-Free Financing!</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Creating your dream kitchen is within easier reach than ever with our THREE interest-free financing options! Qualifying homeowners can qualify for 12 months, 24 months, or 60 months of financing at 0% interest.</p></div><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2020/02/Picture1.webp" alt="0% interest financing available, request an estimate" width="599" height="416" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><div class="el-text"><p>It’s also super simple to <a href="/financing/">apply</a>.</p><p>All you have to do is download and fill out a credit application and submit it to us by either scanning a copy of it or taking a photo of it and sending it to us electronically. Upon approval, you can select your financing terms from the available options.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>We’re Ready To Work With You on Your Kitchen Remodel!</h2><div class="el-text"><p>We’re ready to help you every step of the way with your custom kitchen remodel, from helping you refine your vision to handling a stress-free renovation.</p><p>When you’re ready to get started, <a href="/showrooms/">give us a call and schedule your appointment</a> for your FREE consultation with a kitchen design consultant in one of our showrooms.</p><p>We’d love to help you create the kitchen of your DREAMS!</p></div></div></section>{% endraw %}
